"明_1.csv","pointer":31054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台 其二","author":"黄廷用","text":"汉使安车几度来，同心特诏济川才。\n肯因日暮聊相屈，投札侯生亦壮哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台 其三","author":"黄廷用","text":"谏议大夫坚不拜，何于建武复来招。\n请看唐帝容巢父，鸿鹄冥冥亘紫霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台 其四","author":"黄廷用","text":"同学故人能下贱，榻中加足动星辰。\n若逢圣祖知相迫，肯许严光不汉臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台 其五","author":"黄廷用","text":"滩头七里露渔矶，夜夜春山有少微。\n也信侯封□有命，凌烟不易勒名归。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台 其六","author":"黄廷用","text":"知君故是彺奴态，不厌羊裘钓泽心。\n八十泉灵犹受宠，汉恩还比此滩深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台 其七","author":"黄廷用","text":"若得桐江江上过，汨罗安有楚魂悲。\n汉家晚祚多奇节，尽系清风一钓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台 其八","author":"黄廷用","text":"独上高台捲幔看，俨然遗像肃江干。\n瓣香一献溪前水，习习清风两袖寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中丞刘带川招福州西楼观竞渡 其一","author":"黄廷用","text":"佳节同登江上楼，飞凫点点水中浮。\n舟人不解沉罗事，一醉谁知吊古愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中丞刘带川招福州西楼观竞渡 其二","author":"黄廷用","text":"汀蒲漠漠水盈盈，复有江花相映明。\n夹岸旌旗摇日色，太平箫鼓泛春声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中丞刘带川招福州西楼观竞渡 其三","author":"黄廷用","text":"去岁江城早闭门，今年城外笑歌喧。\n摐金伐□龙舟上，游子谁知主将恩。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]